WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:06.465
"Ahoy, matey!" Oliver said to Harry.

2
00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:10.111
"Will you play pirates with me?"

3
00:00:10.112 --> 00:00:17.276
"Maybe after lunch." Harry went upstairs.

4
00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:20.678
Oliver sighed.

5
00:00:20.679 --> 00:00:28.042
"Hmm," he thought. "How can I play pirates by myself?

6
00:00:28.043 --> 00:00:32.705
I know! I'll bury treasure!"

7
00:00:32.706 --> 00:00:42.338
Oliver collected things from around the house.

8
00:00:42.339 --> 00:00:47.876
He buried his treasure all over the backyard.

9
00:00:47.877 --> 00:00:50.660
Soon it was lunchtime.

10
00:00:50.661 --> 00:00:55.381
"My green robot is missing," Harry said.

11
00:00:55.382 --> 00:00:59.287
"Where's my favorite pencil?" Emmy asked.

12
00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:02.286
Harry and Emmy looked at each other.

13
00:01:02.287 --> 00:01:07.995
"Someone's stealing our stuff!" they said together.

14
00:01:07.996 --> 00:01:16.289
Oliver laughed. "No, I was playing pirates.

15
00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:20.499
I needed some treasure to bury!"

16
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:28.359
"Argh!" Harry roared like a pirate. "Find my robot!"

17
00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:38.852
"Yeah!" Emmy said. "Or you'll walk the plank!"

18
00:01:38.853 --> 00:01:51.753
After lunch the kids went outside and started digging.

19
00:01:51.754 --> 00:01:59.214
"I found my pencil in the garden," Emmy said.

20
00:01:59.215 --> 00:02:04.367
"Where's my robot?" Harry said.

21
00:02:04.368 --> 00:02:09.864
Oliver pointed under a tree. "Try digging there."

22
00:02:09.865 --> 00:02:20.658
"Okay." After a while Harry found his robot.

23
00:02:20.659 --> 00:02:24.962
"Phew! We're done!"

24
00:02:24.963 --> 00:02:31.227
"No, I buried lots more treasure," Oliver said proudly.

25
00:02:31.228 --> 00:02:36.041
"Some coins, a baseball card, a toothbrush.

26
00:02:36.042 --> 00:02:40.371
An earring, a fan, and a spoon."

27
00:02:40.372 --> 00:02:45.506
"But . . ." Emmy looked around the yard.

28
00:02:45.507 --> 00:02:49.612
"Where did you bury them?"

29
00:02:49.613 --> 00:02:55.313
Oliver bit his lip. "I don't remember!"

30
00:02:55.314 --> 00:03:00.409
"Oh, Oliver." Harry groaned.

31
00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:10.571
"Next time make a treasure map!"

